{"seq":3,"slug":"trees-and-spanning","title":"树与生成树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/trees-and-spanning","wordCount":2038,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"树与生成树\">树与生成树</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>树（Tree）是图论中最重要的特殊图类——它是一个<strong>连通且无环</strong>的无向图。等价地，树可以定义为：任意两个顶点之间恰好有一条路径的图。具有 n 个顶点的树恰好有 n-1 条边。</p>\n<p>树在计算机科学中无处不在：文件系统的目录结构、DOM 树、AST（抽象语法树）、二叉搜索树、B 树、最小生成树。树结构的核心优势在于：它以最少的边实现了全连通——去掉任何一条边就不连通，加上任何一条边就产生环。</p>\n<p><strong>生成树</strong>（Spanning Tree）是图 G 的一个子图，它包含 G 的所有顶点且是一棵树。任何连通图都至少有一个生成树。<strong>最小生成树</strong>（MST）是加权图中边权之和最小的生成树，在网络设计中用于找到最低成本的全连接方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[树的等价定义]&#10;    A --&gt; B[连通 + 无环]&#10;    A --&gt; C[n 顶点 + n-1 边 + 连通]&#10;    A --&gt; D[任意两点间恰一条路径]&#10;    A --&gt; E[连通 + 删任意边不连通]&#10;    A --&gt; F[无环 + 加任意边产生环]\">graph TB\n    A[树的等价定义]\n    A --&gt; B[连通 + 无环]\n    A --&gt; C[n 顶点 + n-1 边 + 连通]\n    A --&gt; D[任意两点间恰一条路径]\n    A --&gt; E[连通 + 删任意边不连通]\n    A --&gt; F[无环 + 加任意边产生环]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>编程对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>树</td>\n<td>连通无环图</td>\n<td>n 顶点 n-1 边</td>\n<td>树数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>森林</td>\n<td>无环图（不一定连通）</td>\n<td>k 棵树有 n-k 边</td>\n<td>并查集的初始状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根树</td>\n<td>有根的有向树</td>\n<td>恰一个根节点</td>\n<td>DOM、AST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成树</td>\n<td>包含所有顶点的树子图</td>\n<td>保持连通性</td>\n<td>网络骨架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MST</td>\n<td>最小权的生成树</td>\n<td>全连接最低成本</td>\n<td>网络设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶节点</td>\n<td>度数为 1 的顶点</td>\n<td>树的末端</td>\n<td>终端状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"树的性质与特征\">树的性质与特征</h2><p>树有许多等价的特征定义，理解它们之间的关系有助于灵活运用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>G 是连通的且有 n-1 条边</li>\n<li>G 是无环的且有 n-1 条边</li>\n<li>G 中任意两个顶点之间恰有一条简单路径</li>\n<li>G 是连通的，但删除任何一条边后不连通</li>\n<li>G 是无环的，但添加任何一条边后产生恰好一个环</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>根树</strong>（Rooted Tree）是指定了一个特殊顶点（根）的树。根树中，每个非根节点有唯一的父节点，从根到任意节点的路径唯一。根树的深度（高度）是根到最远叶节点的路径长度。</p>\n<p><strong>二叉树</strong>是每个节点最多有两个子节点的根树。满二叉树的叶节点数 = 内部节点数 + 1，具有 n 个节点的二叉树高度至少为 ⌊log₂n⌋。这些性质直接关系到基于树的数据结构（BST、堆）的性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  value: T;&#10;  children: TreeNode&lt;T&gt;[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function treeHeight&lt;T&gt;(node: TreeNode&lt;T&gt;): number {&#10;  if (node.children.length === 0) return 0;&#10;  return 1 + Math.max(...node.children.map(treeHeight));&#10;}&#10;&#10;function countLeaves&lt;T&gt;(node: TreeNode&lt;T&gt;): number {&#10;  if (node.children.length === 0) return 1;&#10;  return node.children.reduce((sum, child) =&gt; sum + countLeaves(child), 0);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function countEdges&lt;T&gt;(node: TreeNode&lt;T&gt;): number {&#10;  return node.children.length + node.children.reduce((sum, child) =&gt; sum + countEdges(child), 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> treeHeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(treeHeight));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countLeaves</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countLeaves</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countEdges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countEdges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Cayley 公式</strong>：n 个有标记顶点的不同树有 nⁿ⁻² 棵。例如，3 个顶点有 3¹ = 3 棵不同的标记树，4 个顶点有 4² = 16 棵。这个公式可以通过 Prüfer 序列证明——每棵标记树唯一对应一个长度为 n-2 的序列。</p>\n<p>Prüfer 序列的构造：反复删除标记最小的叶节点，记录其邻居，直到只剩两个节点。逆过程可以从 Prüfer 序列还原出原树。这个双射证明了标记树的数量恰好是 nⁿ⁻²（序列中每个位置有 n 种选择，共 n-2 个位置）。</p>\n<p><strong>树的直径</strong>是树中最长路径的长度。可以通过两次 BFS 计算：第一次从任意节点出发找到最远节点 u，第二次从 u 出发找到最远节点 v，u 到 v 的距离就是直径。这个 O(n) 算法的正确性基于树的路径唯一性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最小生成树算法\">最小生成树算法</h2><p><strong>Kruskal 算法</strong>：按边权从小到大排序，依次添加不产生环的边。使用并查集检测环。时间复杂度 O(m log m)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function kruskalMST(&#10;  n: number,&#10;  edges: Array&lt;{ u: number; v: number; weight: number }&gt;,&#10;): Array&lt;{ u: number; v: number; weight: number }&gt; {&#10;  edges.sort((a, b) =&gt; a.weight - b.weight);&#10;  const uf = new UnionFind(n);&#10;  const mst: typeof edges = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const edge of edges) {&#10;    if (uf.find(edge.u) !== uf.find(edge.v)) {&#10;      uf.union(edge.u, edge.v);&#10;      mst.push(edge);&#10;      if (mst.length === n - 1) break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return mst;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kruskalMST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  edges</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-da